1
00:00:00,951 --> 00:00:02,911
(Leonard:)Wait. So we just go over there?

2
00:00:03,078 --> 00:00:05,708
(Howard:)No. We have a little prep work to do.

3
00:00:05,872 --> 00:00:08,912
(Howard:)Put this in your mouth, we walk past them,
you stumble a bit.

4
00:00:09,084 --> 00:00:11,374
I say, "Sorry,
my friend's had a little too much."

5
00:00:11,544 --> 00:00:14,884
(Howard:)And then I start to pull it
out of your mouth and say:

6
00:00:15,048 --> 00:00:17,638
"A little too much fun."

7
00:00:17,801 --> 00:00:19,051
[LAUGHS]

8
00:00:19,219 --> 00:00:22,639
(Howard:)Get it? I mean, they're laughing,
we're laughing. Then we get them up...

9
00:00:22,806 --> 00:00:26,476
...to about a 0.15 blood alcohol level
and tell them we're millionaires.

10
00:00:28,561 --> 00:00:30,231
(Leonard:)What else you got?

11
00:00:30,397 --> 00:00:34,527
(Howard:)Depends. Are you willing to sit on my lap
and pretend to be a ventriloquist's dummy?

12
00:00:34,693 --> 00:00:35,943
(Penny:)No.

13
00:00:36,111 --> 00:00:39,571
(Howard:)I can't sit on your lap.
You don't know the routine.

14
00:00:41,741 --> 00:00:45,991
(Stuart:)I'm sorry, but you're obviously stuck
in a pre-Zero Hour DC Universe.

15
00:00:46,162 --> 00:00:49,622
(Sheldon:)Of course I am. Removing Joe Chill
as the killer of Batman's parents...

16
00:00:49,791 --> 00:00:52,081
(Sheldon:)...effectively deprived him
of his raison d'être.

17
00:00:53,169 --> 00:00:56,509
(Stuart:)You can throw all the French around
you want, it doesn't make you right.

18
00:00:57,007 --> 00:00:59,027
(Sheldon:)Au contraire.

